Disclaimer: this is an unofficial, community tool. It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Lenovo. It writes to the embedded controller,
which controls cooling; a wrong value can raise temperatures or trigger
throttling. Every EC write in this project is range-clamped and logged, and the
hardware behavior on the reference machine is documented in docs/. Read it
before changing limits, and never run a modified build without the safety
clamps in place.

本项目为第三方非官方工具，与联想公司无关。它直接写入 EC 以控制散热，错误取值会
影响温度与性能；代码里所有转速写入都有区间夹取与日志。改动前请先阅读 docs/ 下的
实测记录，并在自己的机器上跑过 fanctl test 再使用。
